      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently highlight the welcoming and compassionate nature of the veterinary team on College Street. Clients appreciate front desk coordinators and veterinarians who remain calm and supportive during both routine appointments and urgent health emergencies. While one visitor reported a delayed response at reception, the vast majority praise the staff for their dedication."
