        "en": "Gentle handling for companion pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers note that both dogs and cats receive exceptionally gentle and attentive care from the doctors and technicians. Several clients observe that even nervous or anxious animals settle quickly due to the patient handling and comforting techniques used during examinations. Visitors also appreciate the special accommodations provided for senior pets."
      }
    },
    {
