      "title": {
        "en": "Clear medical guidance and communication"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners value the clear, informative explanations provided by the clinic staff regarding medical diagnoses and treatment plans. Reviewers mention that doctors take time to answer all questions without rushing, helping families understand their options. Clients also appreciate upfront discussions about estimates and clear guidance on caring for pets at home."
      }
    }
